the image to enlarge.</figcaption></figure>}{s.id==='detail'&&<figure><a href="/assets/guide/guide-findsheet-related.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/assets/guide/guide-findsheet-related.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Findsheet related products below the details"/></a><figcaption>Scroll to Related products to compare other items in the same category.</figcaption></figure>}<div class="step-check"><strong>Check before continuing</strong><p>{s.check}</p></div></section>)}<section class="article-sources"><h2>Official process and screenshot sources</h2><p>The Findsheet and public LoongBuy screenshots were captured on November 17, 2026. Checkout, warehouse, shipping and tracking use older examples published in the official Shopping Process tutorial.</p><ul><li><a href="https://service.loongbuy.com/en/content/process" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official LoongBuy Shopping Process ↗</a></li><li><a href="https://service.loongbuy.com/en/content/help" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official help center ↗</a></li><li><a href="https://loongbuy.com/product-details?url=https://weidian.com/item.html?itemID=7872202082" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Example product on LoongBuy ↗</a></li></ul></section><div class="detail-links"><a class="button" href="/#spreadsheet">Find your next product ↗</a><a class="outline" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ ↗</a></div></div></div></main><Footer/></body></html>
